      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a VIP table in the Claude Monet dining room, wealthy guests taste the newly served black caviar delicacy. Completely oblivious to the kitchen's culinary disguise, the diners rave about its fresh natural Astrakhan quality. Listen to their conversation in Russian first, then we will break down each line in English.",
